{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/uk-india-free-trade-agreement-business-mobility-explainer","content_id":"c1060d10-aa49-431c-89b2-5b9e886e876f","description":"Information on the provisions related to mobility in the UK-India Free Trade Agreement.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9393760","isbn":"","title":"UK-India Free Trade Agreement Business Mobility explainer ","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":true,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/uk-india-free-trade-agreement-business-mobility-explainer/uk-india-free-trade-agreement-business-mobility-explainer"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Business mobility allows professionals to travel temporarily to another country to deliver services. This document explains the provisions of the UK-India Free Trade Agreement that relate to it.  </p>\n\n<p>This explainer covers:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>what business mobility is</li>\n  <li>how it works</li>\n  <li>what has been agreed on Business Mobility in the UK-India <abbr title=\"Free Trade Agreement\">FTA</abbr>\n</li>\n  <li>the potential impacts of the Business Mobility Chapter in the UK-India <abbr title=\"Free Trade Agreement\">FTA</abbr> <br>\n<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Page updated to reflect that the agreement entered in to force on 15 July 2026.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-14T23:01:07Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-07-23T21:30:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Promotional material","emphasised_organisations":["aa750cdf-7925-429d-a2b3-0d9fa47d2c48"],"featured_attachments":["9393760"],"first_public_at":"2025-07-23T22:30:00.000+01:00","political":false,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"promotional","first_published_at":"2025-07-23T22:30:00+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/uk-india-free-trade-agreement-business